{"ID":"20250912112544-jgkomga","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250912112544-jgkomga","title":"UPL3——Unity Profiler 脚本控制","type":"doc","updated":"20250915111826"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250912113441-eo7zwr4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250912113441-eo7zwr4","updated":"20250915111826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250912113452-q2sgdq4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250912113452-q2sgdq4","updated":"20250915111826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Profiler.GetMonoUsedSizeLong()\t\t\t\t\t// 获取当前使用的Mono堆内存(单位：字节）\nProfiler.GetMonoHeapSizeLong()\t\t\t\t\t// 获取Mono堆的总大小，用来判断Mono内存是否接近上限\nProfiler.usedHeapSizeLong\t\t\t\t\t\t// 当前堆中使用的内存总量，包括所有托管内存\nProfiler.GetTotalAllocatedMemoryLong()\t\t\t// 获取所有Unity正在使用的内存总量（包括 Mono、Native、图形资源等）\nProfiler.GetTotalReservedMemoryLong()\t\t\t// 返回Unity从操作系统申请的内存总量，不管是否已经用上\nProfiler.GetTotalUnusedReservedMemoryLong()\t\t// 返回Unity保留了但尚未分配出去的内存部分，即“空闲缓存池”\nProfiler.GetRuntimeMemorySizeLong()\t\t\t\t// 获取某个对象占用的内存（估算值），包括纹理、网格等对象的实际内存占用\nProfiler.BeginSample()\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 开始一个自定义采样区段，常用于标记性能热点段\nProfiler.EndSample()\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 结束一个自定义采样区段\nProfiler.enableBinaryLog\t\t\t\t\t\t// 控制是否将将Profiler数据写入文件\nProfiler.logFile\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t// 设置Profiler数据文件保存位置和文件名\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250912112544-v747vjo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250912112544-v747vjo","updated":"20250915110332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Profiler 提供的重要API"}]},{"ID":"20250912112720-l06km3n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250912112720-l06km3n","updated":"20250915110332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Mono 托管堆（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 层内存）"}]},{"ID":"20250912112755-0s7x0ae","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250912112755-0s7x0ae","updated":"20250915110332"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250912112831-lwoik5y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250912112831-lwoik5y","name":"Profiler.GetMonoUsedSizeLong()","updated":"20250915110309"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250912112831-nv2vj0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250912112831-nv2vj0l","updated":"20250912112917"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"获取当前使用的 Mono 堆内存（单位：字节），关注脚本（C"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"#"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）对象占用的内存"}]},{"ID":"20250912112917-w7ejs8n","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250912112917-w7ejs8n","updated":"20250915110050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"Debug.Log($\"Mono堆内存: {Profiler.GetMonoUsedSizeLong()}\");\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250915110150-zt75n1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915110150-zt75n1v","updated":"20250915110309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250915110309-1a8n3g8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250912112831-6s2qpve","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250912112831-6s2qpve","name":"Profiler.GetMonoHeapSizeLong()","updated":"20250915110320"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250912112831-phj6ppu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250912112831-phj6ppu","updated":"2025091211285